  "source_rule": "The ACKEPOCH door is after a possible setAcceptedEpoch(newEpoch) and immediately before writePacket(ackNewEpoch,true). A thrown IOException is caught by Follower.followLeader; an exact same-peer/thread/epoch retry may send a new ACKEPOCH packet.",
